  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Though Furkurokuju has a monopoly on raising the dead, he's willing to do so with less pomp and ritual if it's for a friend.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Onmyōji level 14th, know the fukorokuju's call petition</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> The material components cost of the fukorokuju's call petition is reduced by half, to a cost of 2,500 gp.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> You may only have one friendship feat.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/friendship-feats#toc4\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
